{
  "comment": [
    "Where common Cortex-M families map Flash and SRAM, keyed by the prefix of",
    "a part number as printed on the package. This is the one thing an analyst",
    "can read off a chip that the image itself never states, and it is not in",
    "CMSIS-SVD, which describes peripherals rather than memory.",
    "",
    "These are hints that get scored like any other evidence, never assertions.",
    "A part linked somewhere unusual still wins on its own evidence.",
    "",
    "Keep this small and each entry defensible. It is deliberately not a",
    "signature database: 0x00000000 / 0x20000000 is the ARM default and is",
    "listed only where a family is worth recognising by name."
  ],
  "families": [
